				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>running from the head, catarrh</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				405d
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cra.</u>
				440c
			</span></i>, etc.: distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυζα</span>
			etc. by <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.263
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				440d
			</span></i>.</div>
